1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:11,400
Nigeria, we hail thee,

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:17,000
Our own dear native land,

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Though tribe and tongue may differ,

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,500
In brotherhood we stand

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,400
Nigerians all,

6
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:39,500
And proud to serve our sovereign Motherland.

7
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:46,000
Our flag shall be a symbol

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000
That truth and justice reign,

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:56,700
In peace or battle honoured,

10
00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:02,000
And this we count as gain,

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,500
To hand on to our children

12
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:13,500
A banner without stain.

13
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,700
O God of all creation,

14
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:25,300
Grant this our one request:

15
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:30,800
Help us to build a nation

16
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:36,000
Where no man is oppressed,

17
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:42,500
And so with peace and plenty

18
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:49,000
Nigeria may be blessed.